	(text "Amps stay muted (SHUTDOWN pulled to +5V) unless the firmware toggles AUDIO_ALIVE\nfrom the audio callback. Each rising edge retriggers U3; if edges stop for ~10 ms\n(Rext x Cext), Q falls, Q2 turns off and the amps mute. Also muted while the Daisy is\nabsent, booting or in DFU (B is held low). Wire the rev 2 speaker amp mute to AMP_SHUTDOWN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
